### Link previews and embedded media in messages.

## Why a YouTube video won't play here

embed-youtube-owner-only = Its owner only allows it on YouTube
embed-youtube-removed = Removed or made private on YouTube
embed-youtube-refused = YouTube won't play it in other apps

## Copying a Nostr reference that didn't load

# $kind is the code, like "nevent" or "naddr".
embed-copy = Copy { $kind }
# $kind is the code, like "nevent" or "naddr".
embed-copied = The { $kind } copied
